== Description ==

'''Paper''' is a raw material in ''[[Human Host]]'', harvested from the world (trees, rocks, salvage). It appears as an ingredient in 5 downstream recipes at the [[Gunsmith Workbench]], including [[12x70mm Chrome]], [[12x70mm Tungsten]], [[12x70mm Titanium]], [[12x70mm Copper]], [[12x70mm Steel]]. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

